<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Get the wall to 1 hit (0-70 health), after that use the macro and it will automatically replace it, you can put the macro in the keybind you want (in keyran).

If you have issues, contact me or another macro creator, thank you for using the macro, and enjoy it</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 0 s
LeftUp 1
Delay 0 s
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 0 s
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 0 s
LeftDown 1
Delay 0 s
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>